<main id="main"><section class="pageHero"><div class="container"><span class="kicker">FAQ</span><h1>Common questions</h1><p>How ordering, provisioning, billing communication and support work.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container faqList"><details open><summary>Does VPN4U own every datacentre and server?</summary><p>No. We are an independent service provider that sources infrastructure through established datacentre and network partners. VPN4U manages the customer relationship and the service sold under our brand.</p></details><details><summary>When do I pay?</summary><p>We confirm the requested configuration and availability before payment is requested. Online checkout is not currently required to submit an order request.</p></details><details><summary>How fast is provisioning?</summary><p>VPS and VPN services are commonly available within one business day after approval. Dedicated servers are normally within 1–3 business days, subject to hardware stock and any custom configuration.</p></details><details><summary>Do I get root access?</summary><p>VPS and dedicated server products are intended to provide administrative access to the operating system unless a specific managed service says otherwise.</p></details><details><summary>Can I use the service for anything I want?</summary><p>No. All services must be used lawfully and in accordance with our Acceptable Use Policy. Spam, malware, abusive automation, attacks, illegal content and activity that harms networks or third parties are prohibited.</p></details><details><summary>Are backups included?</summary><p>Do not assume backups are included unless they are explicitly listed in your order. Customers remain responsible for maintaining appropriate backups of their data.</p></details><details><summary>What happens if dedicated hardware is out of stock?</summary><p>We will offer the closest available alternative or ask whether you prefer to wait. We do not request payment for an unavailable configuration.</p></details><details><summary>Where are services hosted?</summary><p>VPS capacity can be available across Europe, North America and Asia-Pacific. Our standard dedicated range is offered from European datacentres. Exact location is confirmed during ordering.</p></details></div></section></main>
